 "title": "50 Ω surface-mount RF transformer, 1:1 impedance ratio, 20 to 1200 MHz",
 "source": {
  "document": "M158496",
  "revision": "REV. F",
  "pages": 1
 },
 "summary": "A 1:1 impedance-ratio RF transformer for 50 Ω systems, built as a balanced transmission-line design and covering 20 to 1200 MHz. Inside its 1 dB bandwidth the outputs stay matched to 0.3 dB in amplitude and 3 degrees in phase, typical. It handles 2 W of RF and up to 30 mA DC, sits in the six-terminal CD542 surface-mount case and can be washed in water. Listed uses are impedance matching, balanced amplifiers, baluns, cellular and VHF equipment.",
