   "topic": "Winding configuration",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Configuration G: two coupled windings, each drawn in two sections, with the primary terminals on one side and the secondary terminals on the other; a dot marks the in-phase end of each. Pin 1 is primary dot, pin 3 primary, pin 6 secondary dot, pin 4 secondary; pins 2 and 5 are unused."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Construction",
   "page": 1,
